[00:13.78]Sing to God a song, A song of praise that’s bold and new.
[00:20.95]Tell of all the great things He’s done and yet will do.
[00:29.20]Praise his mighty arm; He is the God of victory.
[00:37.40]In the cause of justice,
[00:40.69]He judges righteously.
[00:45.05](Chorus)
[00:45.20]Sing, sing, sing!
[00:48.68]The new song, let it ring!
[00:53.56]Sing, sing, sing!
[00:57.18]Jehovah is our King.
[01:01.32]Make a joyful shout, A joyful cry to God, our King!
[01:08.10]Laud his name, give honor; A joyful anthem sing.
[01:10.53]Join the mighty crowd, And sing aloud before the Lord.
[01:13.35]Harp and horn and trumpet
[01:14.72]Sound praise in full accord.
[01:16.08](Chorus)
[01:16.23]Sing, sing, sing!
[01:17.02]The new song, let it ring!
[01:18.26]Sing, sing, sing!
[01:19.05]Jehovah is our King.
[01:20.10]Let the mighty sea And all that fills it give him praise.
[01:28.50]Join with earth’s creation, And joyful voices raise.
[01:32.42]Let the land rejoice, And let the rivers clap their hands.
[01:36.16]Mountains, hills, and valleys
[01:39.86]Sing praise in all the lands.
[01:44.19](Chorus)
[01:44.34]Sing, sing, sing!
[01:47.72]The new song, let it ring!
[01:52.86]Sing, sing, sing!
[01:56.12]Jehovah is our King.
